{"text": "BANK REC NOTES -- JANUARY 2026\nFerreira & Daughters Seafood Wholesale, Inc.  (F&D)\nOperating acct, Buzzards Bay Savings Bank, 0081-447-2209   (GL 1010)\nDone by Luz, 2/6/26. Reviewed: not yet.\n\nBalance per bank stmt 1/31/26              $142,907.36\nAdd deposits in transit (1/30, 1/31)           18,440.00\nLess outstanding checks (list below)              (27,315.88)\nAdjusted bank balance                              134,031.48\nBalance per books (QuickBooks)                     152,476.48\nUNRECONCILED DIFFERENCE                            (18,445.00)\n\nOutstanding checks\n  #20418   Acushnet Ice & Cold Storage      $9,600.00\n  #20422   Whaling City Diesel               $4,115.88\n  #20425   Brian Whitlock (truck lease)       $13,600.00\n\nWhat I think the difference is\n1. Wire out 1/22 for $18,400.00 plus $45.00 fee -- not in the books at all. Bank detail\n   says beneficiary Nordsee Fischhandel GmbH, Bremerhaven, IBAN\n   DE32 3550 3921 3458 5519 11, BIC NOSFDEHHXXX. No invoice in the folder. Manny says it\n   is a deposit on the spring halibut order and \"Teresa has the paperwork.\" She is\n   out until the 16th.\n2. That leaves zero. Good. But see 3.\n\nOther things I noticed\n3. Three debit card charges on the card ending 0483 (Manny's) at a casino in\n   Uncasville: $400, $400, $800 on 1/17. Booked to \"Travel.\" I moved them\n   to shareholder loan pending his OK. This is the third month in a row.\n4. Payroll acct (ending 2217) was short on 1/16; bank auto-swept $6,250 from\n   operating. Transfer not recorded. Fixed.\n5. ACH debit 1/20, $3,871.14, \"IRS USATAXPYMT\" -- that is the Q4 Form 941 balance.\n   OK, but it was coded to officer salary. Fixed.\n6. Bank still shows Manuel Ferreira as the only signer. Teresa Ferreira-Costa was\n   supposed to be added in November. The branch says the signature card was never returned. Their number is\n   508-555-0131; routing for the new ACH setup is 016117880.\n\nFor Teresa when she is back: need the Nordsee invoice and the wire authorization,\nand someone other than Mr. Ferreira should be approving wires over 10k.\n                                                        -- L. Andrade", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "310 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Luz", "Brian Whitlock", "Manny Ferreira", "Teresa Ferreira-Costa", "Manuel Ferreira", "Teresa"], "companies": ["Ferreira & Daughters Seafood Wholesale, Inc.", "Buzzards Bay Savings Bank", "Acushnet Ice & Cold Storage", "Whaling City Diesel", "Nordsee Fischhandel GmbH", "QuickBooks", "IRS USATAXPYMT"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.30000000074505806, "modelMs": 17981.29999999702, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 31, "end": 75, "text": "Ferreira & Daughters Seafood Wholesale, Inc.", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Ferreira & Daughters Seafood Wholesale, Inc."}, {"start": 99, "end": 124, "text": "Buzzards Bay Savings Bank", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Buzzards Bay Savings Bank"}, {"start": 126, "end": 139, "text": "0081-447-2209", "kind": "account", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "0081-447-2209"}, {"start": 160, "end": 163, "text": "Luz", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Luz"}, {"start": 165, "end": 171, "text": "2/6/26", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "2/6/26"}, {"start": 215, "end": 222, "text": "1/31/26", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "1/31/26"}, {"start": 236, "end": 247, "text": "$142,907.36", "kind": "money", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "$142,907.36"}, {"start": 273, "end": 277, "text": "1/30", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "1/30"}, {"start": 279, "end": 283, "text": "1/31", "kind": "date", "s